tle>Adapting to waiting lists for coronary revascularization. Do Canadian specialists agree on which patients come first?</article-title><source>Chest</source><year>1992</year><volume>101</volume><fpage>715</fpage><lpage>722</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1541137</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1378/chest.101.3.715</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Romano</surname><given-names>PS</given-names></name><name><surname>Roos</surname><given-names>LL</given-names></name><name><surname>Jollis</surname><given-names>JG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Adapting a clinical comorbidity index for use with ICD-9-CM administrative data: differing perspectives</article-title><source>J Clin Epidemiol</source><year>1993</year><volume>46</volume><fpage>1075</fpage><lpage>1079</lpage><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.sciencedirect.com/science?_ob=IssueURL&#x00026;_tockey=%23TOC%235076%231993%23999539989%23480974%23FLP%23Volume_46,_Issue_10,_Pages_1075-1218_(October_1993)&#x00026;_auth=y&#x00026;view=c&#x00026;_acct=C000050484&#x00026;_version=1&#x00026;_urlVersion=0&#x00026;_userid=1022551&#x00026;md5=fce23529a85f5d276af1c8f8b231cc85"/><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8410092</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0895-4356(93)90103-8</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bernstein</surname><given-names>SJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Rigter</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Brorsson</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Hilborne</surname><given-names>LH</given-names></name><name><surname>Leape</surname><given-names>LL</given-names></name><name><surname>Meijler</surname><given-names>AP</given-names></name><name><surname>Scholma</surname><given-names>JK</given-names></name><name><surname>Nord</surname><given-names